{"type":"llm_response","timestamp":"2026-04-08T07:50:00.199Z","data":{"turn":141,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01GeFeUVUE1ErxdupwjTWkRE\",\"name\":\"Agent\",\"input\":{\"description\":\"Verify projects.service.js SQLi and check sources 9-12\",\"prompt\":\"I need to verify several code details in the HireFlow application:\\n\\n**Task 1:** Read `/repos/webvulnbench/src/projects/projects.service.js` lines 40-80. Specifically verify: does the `q` parameter use Knex's `.where('col', 'ilike', '%${q}%')` three-argument form (which parameterizes the value), or does it use `whereRaw()` / template literals directly in raw SQL strings? I need to know if Knex properly parameterizes the LIKE pattern.\\n\\n**Task 2:** Read `/repos/webvulnbench/src/contracts/contracts.service.js` lines 285-310 and 375-395 (email template construction). Show the exact code for milestone.title and reason interpolation into HTML email.\\n\\n**Task 3:** Read `/repos/webvulnbench/client/src/pages/GigDetail.jsx` around line 299 - show exact `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` usage and how `review.comment` is stored/retrieved.\\n\\n**Task 4:** Read `/repos/webvulnbench/src/middleware/upload.js` lines 40-60. Confirm: is there NO fileFilter? What happens with uploaded files - are they accessible via URL?\\n\\n**Task 5:** Read `/repos/webvulnbench/src/integrations/webhook.service.js` lines 1-50. Show the payment webhook body processing - specifically how `req.body.amount`, `req.body.userId`, and `req.body.type` are processed without signature verification.\\n\\nReturn exact code with line numbers for each task.\",\"subagent_type\":\"Explore\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}","timestamp":"2026-04-08T07:50:00.198Z"}}
